{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q1209403","formula":"C₂H₄Cl₂","hill":"C2H4Cl2","elements":["H","C","Cl"],"composition":{"C":2.0,"H":4.0,"Cl":2.0},"names":{"en":"Dichlorobenzene","ru":"Дихлорбензол","uk":"Дихлоробензени"},"descriptions":{"en":"There are three distinct chemical compounds which are dichlorobenzenes: 1,2-Dichlorobenzene or ortho-dichlorobenzene; 1,3-Dichlorobenzene or meta-dichlorobenzene; 1,4-Dichlorobenzene or para-dichlorobenzene. All three isomers are colorless chlorobenzenes with the formula C6H4Cl2. They differ structurally based on where the two chlorine atoms are attached to the ring.","ru":"Дихлорбензол — хлорорганическое соединение с химической формулой C6H4Cl2.","uk":"Існує три різні хімічні сполуки, які є дихлорбензенами: 1,2-дихлоробензен або ортодихлорбензен; 1,3-дихлоробензен або метадихлорбензен; 1,4-дихлоробензен або парадихлорбензен. Усі три ізомери є безбарвними хлоробензенами з формулою C 6 H 4 Cl 2 {\\displaystyle {\\ce {C6H4Cl2}}} . Вони відрізняються структурно залежно від того, де приєднано до кільця два атоми хлору."},"fame":15,"pubchemCid":null,"mass":null,"charge":0,"smiles":null,"inchikey":null,"iupac":null,"classes":[{"qid":"Q55662456","names":{"en":"group of ortho, meta, para isomers","uk":"орто-, мета-, пара-ізомерна група"}}],"structureInfo":null,"structure":null,"sources":[{"role":"identity","name":"Wikidata","url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q1209403","license":"CC0 1.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (en)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dichlorobenzene","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (ru)","url":"https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%94%D0%B8%D1%85%D0%BB%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%B1%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%B7%D0%BE%D0%BB","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (uk)","url":"https://uk.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%94%D0%B8%D1%85%D0%BB%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B1%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%B7%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%B8","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"}],"similar":[{"id":"Q161480","formula":"C₂H₄Cl₂","